/IR9aixoS1xd"},"description":"The official departure point for all tours departing from Zurich is Sihlquai Bus Station, near Zurich\u2019s main train station (Z\u00fcrich HB). Please check in at least 15 minutes before departure at the \u201cBest of Switzerland Tours\u201d counter with your QR code on your voucher ready, printed or electronically."}],"end":[{"location":{"ref":"LOC-o0AXGEKPN4wJ9sIG0RAn5JHVMRExEOzXZF36Tb77fDXHyFrupPxj/IR9aixoS1xd"},"description":"The official departure point for all tours departing from Zurich is Sihlquai Bus Station, near Zurich\u2019s main train station (Z\u00fcrich HB). Please check in at least 15 minutes before departure at the \u201cBest of Switzerland Tours\u201d counter with your QR code on your voucher ready, printed or electronically."}],"redemption":{"redemptionType":"NONE","specialInstructions":"We kindly request that you arrive at least 15 minutes prior to departure and check in at the ticket counter marked with ''Best of Switzerland Tours''. Please have your confirmation details and proof of identification (ID) ready. You may present your tour voucher either as a printed copy or electronically on your smartphone or tablet. \n\nIf you are unfamiliar with the location, we recommend allowing extra time for your journey. Should you have any difficulty finding your way, please contact us as early as possible at +41 (0)44 710 50 50. Our team is available to assist you daily from 7:00 to 21:00."},"travelerPickup":{"pickupOptionType":"MEET_EVERYONE_AT_START_POINT","allowCustomTravelerPickup":false}},"timeZone":"Europe/Zurich","description":"Travel from Zurich on a fully guided day trip to the Swiss villages of Grindelwald, Interlaken, and Lauterbrunnen, with transport included. Enjoy a scenic coach ride through the Br\u00fcnig Pass to Interlaken, the heart of the magnificent Jungfrau region. After exploring Interlaken, continue to the charming mountain resort of Grindelwald, the perfect destination for an active holiday. End your day with a visit to Lauterbrunnen, a breathtaking valley home to 72 waterfalls, and admire Staubbach Falls\u2014Switzerland's third-highest waterfall.","inclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Fully guided tour by a professional multilingual guide (English/Spanish)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Transportation in a comfortable air-conditioned coach"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Carbon-balanced operations certified by myclimate"}],"exclusions":[{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Hotel pick-up and drop-off"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Food and drinks (available to purchase during stops)"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Optional activities"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Gratuities"},{"category":"OTHER","categoryDescription":"Other","type":"OTHER","typeDescription":"Other","otherDescription":"Personal expenses"}],"additionalInfo":[{"type":"STROLLER_ACCESSIBLE","description":"Infants and small children can ride in a pram or stroller"},{"type":"PETS_WELCOME","description":"Service animals allowed"},{"type":"PUBLIC_TRANSPORTATION_NEARBY","description":"Public transportation options are available nearby"},{"type":"INFANT_SEATS_AVAILABLE","description":"Specialized infant seats are available"},{"type":"PHYSICAL_MEDIUM","description":"Travelers should have at least a moderate level of physical fitness"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Tour may be operated in reverse order without prior notice, visiting Lauterbrunnen first, followed by Grindelwald and Interlaken in the afternoon"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Note that the optional activities must be booked separately, and availability may vary depending on the time of year"},{"type":"OTHER","description":"Please note that some shops in Interlaken, Grindelwald and Lauterbrunnen are closed on Sundays"}],"cancellationPolicy":{"type":"STANDARD","description":"For a full refund, cancel at least 24 hours before the scheduled departure time.","cancelIfBadWeather":false,"cancelIfInsufficientTravelers":false,"refundEligibility":[{"dayRangeMin":1,"percentageRefundable":100},{"dayRangeMin":0,"dayRangeMax":1,"percentageRefundable":0}]},"bookingConfirmationSettings":{"bookingCutoffType":"START_TIME","bookingCutoffInMinutes":1440,"confirmationType":"INSTANT_THEN_MANUAL","manualConfirmationPeriod":720},"bookingRequirements":{"minTravelersPerBooking":1,"maxTravelersPerBooking":9,"requiresAdultForBooking":true},"languageGuides":[{"type":"GUIDE","language":"en","legacyGuide":"en/SERVICE_GUIDE"},{"type":"GUIDE","language":"es","legacyGuide":"es/SERVICE_GUIDE"}],"bookingQuestions":["SPECIAL_REQUIREMENTS"],"tags":[11930,11938,367653,21439,11903,12046,21972,11889,367661,11928,367654,12028,367652],"destinations":[{"ref":"577","primary":true}],"itinerary":{"itineraryType":"STANDARD","skipTheLine":false,"privateTour":false,"maxTravelersInSharedTour":48,"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":720},"itineraryItems":[{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMZneRzk8aRvZkBhRy3ZR/I="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Begin your journey in Zurich as you board a comfortable, air-conditioned coach and travel through the stunning landscapes of the Bernese Oberland. Along the way, your guide will share fascinating insights into the region\u2019s rich history and natural beauty."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyBD9t5ZUH6LU6p/s1Q5CINE="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":50},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Arrive in Interlaken, where you'll enjoy some leisure time to explore this charming village at your own pace. Your guide will provide helpful suggestions, including scenic viewpoints and local highlights to check out during your visit."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyL/YzaJi/FKSpeZYclaAZKE="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":210},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"Next, continue to the postcard-perfect mountain village of Grindelwald. Nestled in a lush alpine valley and surrounded by towering peaks and glaciers, it offers the perfect setting for adventure or relaxation. Here, you\u2019ll have free time to explore independently. Take the opportunity to ride the cable car up to Mount First, venture into the dramatic Glacier Canyon, or visit Mount Pfingstegg\u2014all optional activities available at your own expense. Each offers unforgettable views and experiences in the heart of the Alps."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMPI/WFhBknADTNgIG9VLGI="}},"duration":{"fixedDurationInMinutes":60},"passByWithoutStopping":false,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"In the afternoon, rejoin your coach for the final stop: Lauterbrunnen. Known for its dramatic cliffs and 72 cascading waterfalls\u2014including the famous Staubbach Falls\u2014this valley invites you to explore its natural beauty during your free time in the village."},{"pointOfInterestLocation":{"location":{"ref":"LOC-6eKJ+or5y8o99Qw0C8xWyMZneRzk8aRvZkBhRy3ZR/I="}},"passByWithoutStopping":true,"admissionIncluded":"NOT_APPLICABLE","description":"After a full day of alpine discovery, relax on the scenic return journey to Zurich, where your tour concludes."}]},"productOptions":[{"productOptionCode":"DEFAULT","description":"","title":"English","languageGuides"